  "bodyHash": "45cc1f3a48ef877c",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/461/vllr_mystery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">你再也无法靠近那个村庄了……</span></span></p>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;color:#f00\">这个模组是一个小型模组，为你的世界添加了一个名为“<span style=\"color:#800000\">Vll r</span>”的生物，它也是都市传说（Creepypasta）中的角色。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;color:#800000\">注意事项<span style=\"color:#f00\">：</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;color:#f00\">- 该模组目前仍处于测试阶段，因此 Vll r 不会自然生成（在未来，他将随机生成在村庄中）。&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;color:#f00\">- 无需其他前置模组</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/456/2023-11-25_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"634\" height=\"236\"></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Vll r 加入了游戏。</span></span></span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/462/2023-11-25_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\"></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">Vll r 生命值：333 护甲值：100 伤害上限：10 无敌帧：10 刻 免疫刷怪笼消失</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">Vll r 通常看起来就像一个普通的村民，并混迹于村民之中。然而，僵尸或灾厄村民不会攻击他，他也不具备任何职业。</span></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/459/vllr_set_the_time.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"783\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">等等，现在是什么时间？</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">Vll r 有时会随机更改游戏内的时间。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/458/vllr_teleported_player.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1037\" height=\"236\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">啊，倒霉的玩家。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">Vll r 会偶尔将随机玩家传送到他身边。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/457/vllr_freeze_effect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"194\"><br></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/460/2023-11-25_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1137\"></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f00;font-size:24px\">你 将 成 为 我 的 玩 具 。</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/463/2023-11-25_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f00;font-size:18px\">你被踢出了你自己的世界……</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f00;font-size:14px\">当他注意到你时，他会施放一个法术冻结你的身体，并在几秒后将你踢出世界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f00;font-size:14px\">（但请放心，你不会被封禁。你可以回到这个世界。）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\">演示视频：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bhlwov7DEGQ?si=3pxoiyZSzLbuHUnC\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Psv0gSRnENA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z6W8Ob0gd6o?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\">如</span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">果你喜欢我的项目，加入我的 Discord 服务器以获取公告！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px;color:#f00\">链接：<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://discord.gg/7mu2fkwjqy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/7mu2fkwjqy</a></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
